// Mirelo Sales - DAX query view tests (bip, generated 2026-10-27 from data/mirelo_sales_dummy_data/checks/control_totals_eur.csv).
// How to run: Power BI Desktop > DAX query view > paste one EVALUATE block > Run. Every row's _pass must be TRUE.
// The window is set the way the report sets it: TREATAS on the disconnected pickers param_anchor_month (closed month),
// param_period (MONTH / QTD / YTD / R12M) and param_market (ALL / PL / RO / PT). FY2025 = YTD anchored on 2025-12.
// Tolerances: EUR 0.011 (control totals are rounded to cents), ratios 0.000001 (6 decimals), counts exact.
// Sets:
//   T-M1  requested windows: Sep 2026, FY2025, FY2026 YTD Sep x ALL / PL / RO / PT x 16 metrics (192 rows)
//   T-M2  every closed month Jan 2024 - Sep 2026 x 4 markets x 16 metrics (2112 rows)
//   T-M3  QTD / YTD / R12M windows = sum of the monthly control values, additive metrics (192 rows; EUR tolerance 0.005 per month summed)
//   T-M4  bridge identity and README rule 2 (8 rows)
//   T-M5  smoke: card SVGs and 13-month trends (56 rows)
// Budget comparisons have no control totals (the generator publishes actuals only); they are not reconciled here.

// T-M1 requested windows: Sep 2026, FY2025, FY2026 YTD Sep (192 rows)
